 "In trials in autoimmune thyroiditis, selenium supplements lowered TPO antibodies over three to twelve months. Food sources were not what those trials tested.": "En ensayos de tiroiditis autoinmune, los suplementos de selenio bajaron los anticuerpos TPO en tres a doce meses. Esos ensayos no probaron las fuentes de comida.",
